{"identity_key": "bilibili:1253780848725983280", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1253780848725983280", "content": "百万销量现象级续作！《掘地求财：铲友齐上阵》宣传片！\n全球销量突破130万套的现象级独立游戏《A Game About Digging A Hole》正式推出全新续作《掘地求财：铲友齐上阵》（A Game About Digging A Hole Together）！\n\n本次不仅带来全新地形、道具与隐藏在地底深处的神秘宝藏，更应全球玩家呼唤新增“跨平台多人在线联机”！快约上好友一起深入沙滩地底挖宝吧！\n\n🎮 游戏名称：掘地求财：铲友齐上阵 (A Game About Digging A Hole™ Together)\n🖥️ 对应平台：PC (Steam) /", "publisher": "松竹游戏", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1253780848725983280", "published_at": "2026-09-30T08:30:02+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T15:27:25.426351+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3690981385833115", "uid": "3690981385833115", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_AV", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 5, "retweets": 0, "replies": 0}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
